WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.140
The state of Florida has issued 
a category five hurricane warning.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.220
All residents must evacuate immediately.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.100
Grab your families,

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.040
your loved ones,

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.080
and get out.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:21.600
Dad!

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.599
We won't be able to come for you.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.440
Dad?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.100
Dad!?

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:38.460
Oh, God.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.700
What happened?

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.240
Haley, are you hurt?

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.000
I'm fine

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.620
Hello, can anybody hear me?

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.160
I'm trapped with my father in our house in Coral Lake.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.760
Haley!

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.260
Please send help!

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:08.000
Haley?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.480
Wade, down here!

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.760
Pete, do you hear that?

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.000
In less than an hour, we'll be under water.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.080
I'm banging on the pipes,

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.400
it blurs their senses.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.140
I can distract them for you.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.280
You got this!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.180
You need to go now!

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.220
I'm not leaving you here.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.720
We're in here!

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:02.760
Come on you son of a bitch.

